From: NeoDarwin
Subject: [PATCH] config: build ARM64 machine code and pmap from source

Apple's public ARM64 configurations never enable nos_arm_asm and
nos_arm_pmap, so osfmk/arm64/{start,locore,cswitch,caches_asm,
machine_routines_asm}.s, pcb.c and the pmap are left out and the public
build expects them from a closed per-SoC archive in the Kernel Debug Kit
(libVMAPPLE.os.RELEASE.a). The source is in the tree; enabling the options
builds it. Measured effect: closes 230 of the 395 VMAPPLE link gaps.

Status: staged for P1-01. With this patch the newly compiled files need
board-config guards for Apple-SoC registers (CPU_OVRD), per-SoC tunables
and the Apple IOMMU headers (arm64/ppl/{sart,uat}.h); that is the SBSA
board config's job.

Rebase-risk: low (two option lists per MASTER file).
---
--- a/config/MASTER.arm64.MacOSX
+++ b/config/MASTER.arm64.MacOSX
@@ -15,9 +15,9 @@
 #  -------- ----- -- ---------------
 #
 #if MASTER_CONFIG_ENABLE_SPTM
-#  ARM_EXTRAS_BASE = [ config_sptm config_sptm_iommu ]
+#  ARM_EXTRAS_BASE = [ config_sptm config_sptm_iommu nos_arm_asm nos_arm_pmap ]
 #else
-#  ARM_EXTRAS_BASE = [ config_pmap_ppl ]
+#  ARM_EXTRAS_BASE = [ config_pmap_ppl nos_arm_asm nos_arm_pmap ]
 #endif
 #  KERNEL_BASE =    [ arm64 medium msgb_large config_requires_u32_munging config_delay_idle_sleep config_proc_udata_storage config_uexc config_darkboot ARM_EXTRAS_BASE ]
 #  KERNEL_RELEASE = [ KERNEL_BASE release ]
--- a/config/MASTER.arm64.WatchOS
+++ b/config/MASTER.arm64.WatchOS
@@ -16,7 +16,7 @@
 #  Standard Apple OS Configurations:
 #  -------- ----- -- ---------------
 #
-#  ARM_EXTRAS_BASE = [ config_pmap_ppl ]
+#  ARM_EXTRAS_BASE = [ config_pmap_ppl nos_arm_asm nos_arm_pmap ]
 #  KERNEL_BASE =    [ arm64 xsmall msgb_small config_embedded config_enforce_signed_code config_code_signature_reconstitution config_requires_u32_munging config_darkboot ARM_EXTRAS_BASE ]
 #  KERNEL_RELEASE = [ KERNEL_BASE release ]
 #  KERNEL_DEV =     [ KERNEL_BASE development mach_assert config_xnupost proc_ref_debug config_proc_resource_limits config_ext_paniclog ]
--- a/config/MASTER.arm64.iPhoneOS
+++ b/config/MASTER.arm64.iPhoneOS
@@ -16,7 +16,7 @@
 #  Standard Apple OS Configurations:
 #  -------- ----- -- ---------------
 #
-#  ARM_EXTRAS_BASE = [ config_pmap_ppl ]
+#  ARM_EXTRAS_BASE = [ config_pmap_ppl nos_arm_asm nos_arm_pmap ]
 #  KERNEL_BASE =    [ arm64 xsmall msgb_small config_embedded config_enforce_signed_code config_code_signature_reconstitution config_requires_u32_munging config_darkboot ARM_EXTRAS_BASE ]
 #  KERNEL_RELEASE = [ KERNEL_BASE release ]
 #  KERNEL_DEV =     [ KERNEL_BASE development mach_assert config_xnupost proc_ref_debug config_proc_resource_limits config_ext_paniclog ]
